{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows疑似PowerShell哈希传递或中继脚本。对应需求：凭据访问。官方：Potential PowerShell Pass-the-Hash/Relay Script。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-windows.powershell*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows疑似PowerShell哈希传递或中继脚本","references":["https://github.com/Kevin-Robertson/Invoke-TheHash/blob/master/Invoke-WMIExec.ps1","https://github.com/Kevin-Robertson/Invoke-TheHash/blob/master/Invoke-SMBExec.ps1","https://github.com/dafthack/Check-LocalAdminHash/blob/master/Check-LocalAdminHash.ps1","https://github.com/nettitude/PoshC2/blob/master/resources/modules/Invoke-Tater.ps1","https://github.com/Kevin-Robertson/Inveigh/blob/master/Inveigh.ps1"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"951779c2-82ad-4a6c-82b8-296c1f691449","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 凭据访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 凭据访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:windows and\n  powershell.file.script_block_text : (\n    (\"NTLMSSPNegotiate\" and (\"NegotiateSMB\" or \"NegotiateSMB2\")) or\n    \"4E544C4D53535000\" or\n    \"0x4e,0x54,0x4c,0x4d,0x53,0x53,0x50\" or\n    \"0x4e,0x54,0x20,0x4c,0x4d\" or\n    \"0x53,0x4d,0x42,0x20,0x32\" or\n    \"0x81,0xbb,0x7a,0x36,0x44,0x98,0xf1,0x35,0xad,0x32,0x98,0xf0,0x38\"\n  ) and\n  not file.directory : \"C:\\ProgramData\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender Advanced Threat Protection\\Downloads\"\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows疑似PowerShell哈希传递或中继脚本\n\n### 为何重要\n窃取或中继域与本机凭据\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1557","name":"Adversary-in-the-Middle","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1557/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1557.001","name":"LLMNR/NBT-NS Poisoning and SMB Relay","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1557/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1550","name":"Use Alternate Authentication Material","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1550/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1550.002","name":"Pass the Hash","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1550/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"version":111,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
